codex
The profile shows a promising C128-specific fuse: replace output norm + `to_out` GEMM with one Triton kernel that normalizes the 128 hidden channels, applies the out gate, and immediately projects to the 128 output channels. That avoids writing and rereading the intermediate `z` tensor on all C128 benchmark cases.
