codex
I’m testing a fused input layernorm + C128 projection/gate pack kernel. It recomputes the layernorm once per hidden-channel tile, but removes the separate layernorm launch and the normalized activation tensor traffic, which may be a better tradeoff for the C128 no-mask benchmarks.
