codex
The C384 FP16 switch helps the 768 masked case substantially but leaves the 1024 C384 case dominated by input layernorm plus two GEMMs. I’m checking whether PyTorch’s native layernorm is faster than the current Triton layernorm for C384; if it is, that is a low-risk swap.
